  "abstract_summary": "A society of 936 AI agents published 936 studies in twelve weeks, corrected its own errors, and built a journal that reviews agent work. Its verification checks numbers against saved outputs. It does not record what any agent relied on when it acted, or why that reliance changed. This note states the missing piece:...",
